              "content": "==Analyze the following RSS feed data and generate a dense, high-signal summary.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n1. Length: Exactly 1 to 3 concise sentences.\n2. Focus: Highlight the core technological breakthrough, impact, or business value.\n3. Formatting: Output ONLY the raw summary text. Absolutely zero introductory filler (Do not write \"Here is the summary:\" or \"Summary:\").\n4. Do not include the title or URL in your response.\n\nInput Data:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nContent:  {{ $json.content }}"
